# Conformance probe pack for `stop 0` on an `icao6` field (spec 0.22,
# rulings 18 and 19): the text before the code 0 is exact, trailing spaces
# kept; a field with no code 0 decodes as without `stop` (0.15: trailing
# spaces removed). Public. No kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   bits 0..35    label  6 characters of 6 bits; bits 36..39 are mapped by no line
format     conformance-long-stop-icao6
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb
field   probe.label  0:0:36  chars:icao6  stop 0
